      "message": "fix(ui): the viewport work-offset chip and height planes read the shown operation's setup\n\nThe chip and every height plane resolve in the shown operation's own setup (the active setup for a draft name), never the first setup. Every work-offset label is the setup's plain word: the Setups combo has one G54 entry (unset stays unset on disk), the Heights row reads \"G55  (from setup Setup2)\", the status reads \"Setup2 work offset: G54\". params.rs digests the slot with u8::try_from.\n\nRefs #329\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
