      "message": "fix(setup)!: the setup defines the work offset, not each height\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: project files are now v52. A height referencing the work offset no longer stores its own G54-G59 slot - the setup defines it. Older builds refuse v52 files, and an older project whose operations used different work-offset slots within one setup is refused at load by name.\n\nRefs #329\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
