      "message": "fix(setup): the setup sheet and refusals say the plain work offset word\n\nReview of #331 (9369577): the setup sheet still printed '(the default - not\npicked)' / '(picked for this setup)', against the rule that a setup's work\noffset is shown everywhere as the plain word G54..G59 (an unset setup is\nG54). It now prints 'program offset: G58'. A refused offset change says\n'work offset not changed' instead of 'not picked'; a test note no longer\nsays 'Auto'.\n\nRefs #329\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
